[32m+[m[32m| **All user-owned persistence on Google places** | Like, Save, add-to-collection, add-to-plan, and Publish Review all hit `GET /rest/v1/places?select=id&id=eq.google:ChIJ…` → **HTTP 400 `invalid input syntax for type uuid`**. Root cause: **live Supabase schema predates migration `0005_place_id_text_google_ids.sql`** — `places.id` (and FKs) are still `uuid`, while the app stores TEXT Google IDs (`google:ChIJ…`). Console: `[VYBE auth] like sync failed` / `save sync failed` |[m
